<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $216 mln repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $216 mln repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said it placed $216 million in overnight repurchase agreements Friday.</p>
<p>The loans to local banks were set at nine percent against government bonds.</p>
<p>In the interbank market, overnight interest rates were flat at 6.88 percent.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar eased to 0.9995 pesos from 0.99982 pesos at the close Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0652</p>
</text>
